<%# Keyed on the question, not on the stakeholder. Every settled contact turn
    used to carry the same id as this row, so Turbo's replace — which resolves
    its target with getElementById — overwrote the *first* one: each new answer
    landed on the oldest, and the row waiting at the bottom stayed empty for
    the rest of the visit. %>
<%= render layout: "shared/transcript_row", locals: {
      id: dom_id(question, :test_pending),
      speaker: contact.full_name,
      from_contact: true,
      body: nil,
      body_id: dom_id(question, :test_pending_body),
      meta: tag.span(t("threads.replying"), class: "kick text-xs text-accent")
    } do %><% end %>
